constantly hurt their community. Game launch was bad, then the \"DLC\" that was provided wasn't actual DLC, it was content that should have been in the game from the beginning. Then they decide to stop further updates to the game about 1.5 years after launch. Feels like more a cash grab than anything. I cannot recommend anyone spending money on this game. If you really want to play this game pirate it. There are better games to spend your money on.", "timestamp_created": 1677193945, "timestamp_updated": 1677193945, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "133448683", "author": {"steamid": "76561199050800684", "personaname": "Celestia", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/YoursTrulyYSK/", "num_games_owned": 166, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2281, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2205, "last_played": 1736209175, "avatar": "44e695caba964df0b692096794e3892cd66b8c6e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game pretty good", "timestamp_created": 1677193143, "timestamp_updated": 1677193143, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "133446424", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037519466", "personaname": "carol", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fr0gwad/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 2551, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 868, "last_played": 1771222229, "avatar": "72c4fc2e0abbfa9b5c11edea53bdfeb36e5ff557"}, "language": "english", "review": "Now that it's finished its entire content line-up, it's fine for what it is. Buy it on-sale. \n\nPayday meets a pandemic, with a card-builder intertwined to enrich gameplay and give it more variety. My biggest complaint is the lack of special infected variety, instead, they make variants of already existent special infected. Some of them simply exist to stifle gameplay, and unfortunately feel more like a hindrance than a justified moment of 'getting caught off guard.' \n\nA *lot* of the movement in this game feels very odd, and getting knocked back is very clunky and drops your input for a time while you're 'stunned'. The shooting is alright, the manner of approach to weapon modification is fine.\n\nGood game to play with a friend or two, when it's $15-$20 bucks.", "timestamp_created": 1677191121, "timestamp_updated": 1677191121, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "133445654", "author": {"steamid": "76561198094635390", "personaname": "Salix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198094635390/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 25961, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 25248, "last_played": 1759384583, "avatar": "64455b3f80e6419b182bf68c483de214f5f56d75"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game ended as it started, broken.\n\ntruly incredible devs", "timestamp_created": 1677190496, "timestamp_updated": 1677190496, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.515723288059234619", "comment_count": 0, "